xed world positions in the second tutorial mechanics info screen.Fixed an error when pressing Enter during the tutorial.Fixed an incorrect visual in the third tutorial mechanics info screen.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T19:25:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040483","verified_at":"2026-10-24T21:00:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3706320-1847286114029965","game_id":"steam-3706320","kind":"announcement","title":"Multiworlds v0.9.2","summary":"Multiworlds v0.9.2 ImprovementsNew worlds in the second tutorial level.Cleaner lock icons on locked items, with the spike lock resized to fit better.Smaller download size.FixesFixed a Best Clear being downgraded to a normal clear if you replayed the fragment with more moves.Leaving a level with the Home button during the death rewind no longer breaks the game.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:39:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029965","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:08:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3706320-1846651706691970","game_id":"steam-3706320","kind":"announcement","title":"Multiworlds meets Steam Next Fest","summary":"Multiworlds v0.9.0 + v0.9.1 NewAchievements: see every achievement and whether you've unlocked it. Hidden ones stay secret until you earn them. An \"Achievement Unlocked\" notification pops up in-game. Progress is saved on your device and syncs to Steam the next time you play with Steam running. Leaderboards: compare your completed timelines on the global Steam leaderboard. You can view the top players or the players around you, with names and avatars. Roadmap: see what's coming next and what's al","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:56:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691970","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3706320-1845383656394694","game_id":"steam-3706320","kind":"announcement","title":"Multiworlds v0.8.0","summary":"NewKey rebinding: Remap your controls from the new Controls tab in Settings.Hotkey hints: On-screen buttons now show the key bound to them, and switch to gamepad icons when you play with a controller. Now the buttons are active by default and can be disabled from settings.Controller vibration: Get those cool haptic feedback feels on deaths, world piece pickups, layer flips and changes, entering portals and level clears.Timelines zoom in and out of the timeline view.Death rewind: When any of the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T21:41:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3706320-1819386365109192","game_id":"steam-3706320","kind":"announcement","title":"Polish and Bug Fixes","summary":"Bug Fixes:Steamworks updateFixed issue with one of the fragments being not solvable.Fixed worlds overlapping in one of the fragments making it insolvable.Fixed switches' link trails being too big and confusing.Fixed incorrect movement speed of the player.Polish:Added fade effect for triggering switches. Updated switch images.Updated lock to be green so as to keep other elements visible behind it. Updated locked image as well.Portals look portal like now.Added flame background to World Pieces. Ea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-26T13:01:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365109192","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3706320-1818118366170172","game_id":"steam-3706320","kind":"update","title":"Art update & Bug Fixes","summary":"Let's be honest, the game looked dull and it had no depth before. With minimalism still the core behind the game's art, find yourself engaging more with improved art. There are other fixes too, but mainly, the game looks better now.If you still need to know about what the fixes are:In-level walls now correctly interact with the player.Death and collecting the last World Piece no longer occurs at the same time. Death occurs first.Demo builds will not hold actual game-data, and vice versa.Fixed no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-03T13:38:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366170172","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3706320-1817483467033435","game_id":"steam-3706320","kind":"announcement","title":"Improved Demo now available","summary":"Dive into the demo to see what the original game will be like. With levels having upto 4 worlds in some fragments, you'll get a glimpse of how tough things can be, and how much worse it may get from there 😉","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-26T12:44:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467033435","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3706320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3706320":"2026-10-26T10:58:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sou